# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MOASYS-Vault — Movies ignore list (EXAMPLE / REFERENCE FILE)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Copy this file to `ignored/movies.yaml` (drop the `.example` suffix) and
# uncomment / edit entries below as needed. The real `movies.yaml` is
# gitignored so personal library decisions don't leak into the repo.
#
# Each entry is a path prefix. Any movies-pass warning whose `path` field
# starts with one of these (followed by `/` or end-of-string,
# case-insensitive, separator-normalized) gets silently dropped from
# `output/movies/warnings.json` (and counted in the run summary).
#
# Get paths from `output/movies/warnings.json` and `output/movies/validation-warnings.json`.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Silence everything under a category ─────────────────────────────────────
# Useful for "Other UHD" / "Other HD" / "Other SD" categories you keep but
# don't actively curate.
# - Other UHD
# - Other SD

# ── Silence a single movie ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Drops every warning whose path is inside this movie's folder (quality
# mismatch, TMDB no-match, naming warnings, etc.).
# - UHD/Some Movie (2020)
# - HD/Old Concert Film (1985)

# ── Silence a specific file ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Pin-point: just one file path. Useful when a specific edition has a
# legitimate warning you've decided to accept.
# - UHD/Blade Runner (1982)/Blade Runner (1982) {edition-Final Cut}.mp4
